,"place_name_jianti_auto":"玄菟","start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"95a15fac-db0e-11ef-a219-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"幷州","place_name_jianti_auto":"幷州","start_index":91,"tongjian_id":"95a15fad-db0e-11ef-86bd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"涼州","place_name_jianti_auto":"凉州","start_index":106,"tongjian_id":"95a15fae-db0e-11ef-9a66-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"敦煌","place_name_jianti_auto":"敦煌","start_index":115,"tongjian_id":"95a15faf-db0e-11ef-b369-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"幽州部涿郡、廣陽、代郡、上谷、漁陽、右北平、遼西、遼東、玄菟、樂浪等郡。幷州部上黨、太原、上郡、西河、五原、雲中、定襄、鴈門、朔方等郡。幽州大郡，戶猶十萬餘，唯玄菟戶一千五百二十四。幷州大郡三萬餘，小郡不滿二千。涼州大郡不滿三萬，敦煌七百四十八而已。少，詩沼翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"幽州部涿郡、广阳、代郡、上谷、渔阳、右北平、辽西、辽东、玄菟、乐浪等郡。幷州部上党、太原、上郡、西河、五原、云中、定襄、鴈门、朔方等郡。幽州大郡，户犹十万余，唯玄菟户一千五百二十四。幷州大郡三万余，小郡不满二千。凉州大郡不满三万，敦煌七百四十八而已。少，诗沼翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"95a15f95-db0e-11ef-a0e7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"束脩，謂束髮自脩者也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"束修，谓束发自修者也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"95a15fb0-db0e-11ef-a2a4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"幽","place_name_jianti_auto":"幽","resolved_place_entity_id":102,"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"95a15fb1-db0e-11ef-b0ee-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"幷","place_name_jianti_auto":"幷","resolved_place_entity_id":186,"start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"95a15fb2-db0e-11ef-ac1a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"涼州","place_name_jianti_auto":"凉州","resolved_place_entity_id":156,"start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"95a15fb3-db0e-11ef-83e7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政","人事"],"content":"4冬，十一月，丙辰，詔曰：「幽、幷、涼州戶口率少，邊役衆劇，束脩良吏進仕路狹。撫接夷狄，以人爲本，其令緣邊郡口十萬以上，歲舉孝廉一人，不滿十萬，二歲舉一人，五萬以下，三歲舉一人。」","content_fanyi":"冬季，十一月十四日，丙辰，汉和帝下诏说：“幽州、并州、凉州户口大多稀少，边地徭役繁重，奉公守法的良吏仕进之路狭窄。安抚和接遇夷狄，最根本的是用人，现在命令：边郡人口在十万以上的，每年举荐孝廉一人；人口不满十万的，每两年举荐一人；人口在五万以下的，每三年举荐一人。”","content_jianti_auto":"4冬，十一月，丙辰，诏曰：「幽、幷、凉州户口率少，边役众剧，束修良吏进仕路狭。抚接夷狄，以人为本，其令缘边郡口十万以上，岁举孝廉一人，不满十万，二岁举一人，五万以下，三岁举一人。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3896,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"95a15f94-db0e-11ef-a3d6-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"右北平郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"右北平郡","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"95a15fb6-db0e-11ef-9347-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雒陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"雒阳","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"95a15fb7-db0e-11ef-9a34-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"右北平郡，在雒陽北二千三百里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"右北平郡，在雒阳北二千三百里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"95a15fb5-db0e-11ef-9b40-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"漁陽太守","official_note":"漁陽太守是漢代地方行政官員，負責漁陽郡的治理和防務，此處在鮮卑入侵時率軍擊退敵人，體現其軍事指揮職能。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"漁陽太守擊破之","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"07849f9a-8da5-432b-9168-cd0ac3e4d528"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"鮮卑","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲜卑","resolved_place_entity_id":218,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"95a15fb8-db0e-11ef-927a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"右北平","place_name_jianti_auto":"右北平","resolved_place_entity_id":1229,"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"95a15fb9-d